            "description": "Switches XETRA to Closed now for {{phaseMinutes}} min (UTC), then calls reset to apply.\nFIX SecurityStatus (35=f): 336=1, 625=10.\nAfter the phase ends the venue returns to Open.\nWARNING: reset clears order books."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Build a phase window starting now (venue timezone = UTC), length = phaseMinutes",
                  "const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
                  "const now = new Date();",
                  "const startMin = now.getUTCHours() * 60 + now.getUTCMinutes();",
                  "const endMin = Math.min(startMin + Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('phaseMinutes')), 24 * 60 - 1);",
                  "const hhmm = m => pad(Math.floor(m / 60)) + ':' + pad(m % 60);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('phaseStart', hhmm(startMin));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('phaseEnd', hhmm(endMin));"
